---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "About GetNexo – Leading AI for WhatsApp Business 2026";
const description = "Discover how GetNexo revolutionized customer service with advanced AI on WhatsApp. Learn about our history, mission, values, and how we help 10,000+ companies automate sales 24/7.";
const keywords = "about getnexo, getnexo history, getnexo mission, whatsapp ia company, customer service ia, chatbot whatsapp brazil, whatsapp sales automation, conversational ia whatsapp, getnexo company, whatsapp ia platform, automatic whatsapp service, whatsapp ia sales, smart whatsapp bot, getnexo mission, getnexo values, whatsapp company history";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
<div class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-container">
    <h1 class="hero-title">GetNexo: Leader in AI for WhatsApp Business in Brazil</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      We are pioneers in artificial intelligence for sales and service on WhatsApp. With GPT-4 Turbo technology and official Meta API, we help more than 10,000 Brazilian companies automate sales 24 hours a day, generating $ 30K/month and winning customers with humanized AI service.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="about-content">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="intro-section">
      <h2>Why Choose GetNexo? The AI Revolution in WhatsApp Business</h2>
      <p>GetNexo is much more than a <a href="/en/blog/ia-customer-service-optimization-2026">WhatsApp chatbot</a> platform. We are a leading company specialized in conversational artificial intelligence for sales and service on WhatsApp. With proprietary technology based on GPT-4 Turbo and direct integration with the Meta Official API, we have revolutionized how companies engage with their customers.</p>

      <p>Learn more about our <a href="/en/integrations">native integrations</a> with Shopify, WooCommerce, VTEX, and logistic systems. Our <a href="/en/pricing">self-hosted</a> platform ensures total control and security of your data.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mission-section">
      <h2>GetNexo Mission: Democratize AI for All Businesses</h2>
      <p>Our mission is clear and ambitious: to democratize access to cutting-edge artificial intelligence for companies of all sizes. We believe that any business, regardless of size or segment, deserves access to <a href="/en/pricing">sentiment analysis</a>, <a href="/en/pricing">smart auto-replies</a>, and <a href="/en/pricing">sales gamification</a> technology.</p>

      <p>That's why we developed a platform that combines ease of use with advanced computing power. Fair pricing models make our solution accessible even for small entrepreneurs who want to compete with e-commerce giants.</p>

      <div class="mission-highlights">
        <h3>What Makes Us Unique</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Global Experience:</strong> Developed with global standards, understanding specific market needs.</li>
          <li><strong>Official Meta API:</strong> Zero risk of banning, maximum security, and compliance with WhatsApp Business policies.</li>
          <li><strong>Self-Hosted:</strong> You control your data, with no dependence on external servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Fair Pricing Model:</strong> Pay for what you use, with no fixed monthly fees in basic tiers.</li>
          <li><strong>Specialized Support:</strong> Technical team ready to help 24/7.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="history-section">
      <h2>GetNexo History: From Idea to Leadership in Conversational AI</h2>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>2022 - The Innovative Idea</h3>
          <p>Founding of GetNexo with a revolutionary vision: to democratize access to AI for sales on WhatsApp. We identified a gap in the market - companies paid fortunes for imported solutions that didn't understand local cultural and commercial realities.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>2023 - First Functional Prototype</h3>
          <p>Launch of the first AI chatbot integrated with the WhatsApp Business API. Using GPT-3.5 technology, we achieved natural conversations, understanding slang, regional expressions, and specific consumer needs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>2024 - Expansion and Innovation</h3>
          <p>Addition of revolutionary features like <a href="/en/pricing">smart ticket system</a>, <a href="/en/pricing">automated loyalty program</a>, and advanced analytics with predictive AI. Integration with over 50 e-commerce and ERP platforms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>2025 - Market Dominance</h3>
          <p>Launch of version 4.0 with GPT-4 Turbo, real-time sentiment analysis, and augmented reality features for sales. More than 10,000 companies already automate their sales with us.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <h3>2026 - Future of Conversational AI</h3>
          <p>Preparing revolutionary launches with voice integration, video-commerce, and metaverse commerce. Our mission continues: to make any business competitive in the AI age.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="values-section">
      <h2>GetNexo Values: Our Business Philosophy</h2>
      <p>GetNexo's values are not just pretty words on a website. They guide all our strategic decisions and product development. Meet the pillars that make our company unique:</p>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🚀</div>
          <h3>Constant Innovation</h3>
          <p>We invest more than 30% of our revenue in research and development. We maintain partnerships with universities and AI research centers to always be at the technological forefront.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Security and Privacy</h3>
          <p>We are pioneers in GDPR compliance in the WhatsApp AI segment. All our customers' data is encrypted end-to-end and stored securely.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>Genuine Partnership</h3>
          <p>We don't see our customers as numbers. We work side-by-side, offering free strategic consulting and personalized technical support to ensure the success of each implementation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🌱</div>
          <h3>Sustainable Growth</h3>
          <p>We believe true success comes from mutual growth. That's why we developed our platform to scale alongside our customers, from small entrepreneurs to large corporations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🌍</div>
          <h3>Global Vision</h3>
          <p>We are proud of our roots and focused on global impact. Our technology is developed by experts to contribute to the digital economy worldwide.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">💡</div>
          <h3>Total Transparency</h3>
          <p>We hide nothing from our customers. All code is auditable, prices are clear, and we offer a satisfaction guarantee with extended trial periods.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="impact-section">
      <h2>GetNexo Impact: Numbers That Speak for Themselves</h2>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">10.000+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Companies Served</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">$ 300M+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Revenue Generated</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">500M+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Messages Processed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">99.9%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Customer Satisfaction</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>These numbers represent more than statistics. Each company served by GetNexo represents jobs preserved, businesses saved, and entrepreneurs realizing their dreams. Our technology doesn't just sell more - it transforms lives.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
      <h2>Ready to Revolutionize Your Business with AI?</h2>
      <p>Join more than 10,000 companies that have already transformed their results with GetNexo. Start for free today and see your business grow exponentially.</p>

      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/en/create-bot" class="btn-primary-glow">Start for Free Now</a>
        <a href="/en/contact" class="btn-outline">Schedule Consulting</a>
      </div>

      <p class="final-note">Don't waste any more time. Every day without automation is revenue left on the table. Your competitor is already using AI - are you?</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #030712 0%, #0f172a 100%);
    padding: 10rem 5% 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-content {
    padding: 4rem 5%;
    background: #030712;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .intro-section, .mission-section, .history-section, .values-section, .impact-section, .cta-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .intro-section h2, .mission-section h2, .history-section h2, .values-section h2, .impact-section h2, .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro-section p, .mission-section p, .impact-section p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .intro-section p, .mission-section p {
    text-align: left;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .mission-highlights {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .mission-highlights h3 {
    color: #00d4ff;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mission-highlights ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .mission-highlights li {
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #00d4ff;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .mission-highlights li strong {
    color: white;
  }

  .timeline {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .timeline-item h3 {
    color: #00d4ff;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .timeline-item p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .value-item {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }

  .value-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .value-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .value-item h3 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .value-item p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  .stat-item {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #00d4ff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .final-note {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #00d4ff;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary-glow {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #00ff9d);
    color: black;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-primary-glow:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #94a3b8;
    border: 2px solid #94a3b8;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: #00d4ff;
    color: #00d4ff;
    background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .intro-section h2, .mission-section h2, .history-section h2, .values-section h2, .impact-section h2, .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .mission-highlights {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
</Layout>
